  "content": "<h1>更好的配方书</h1><p>为原版配方书添加了酿造、锻造和一些生活质量改进！</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/D7kcXWaZra\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/D7kcXWaZra</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbrb\" rel=\"nofollow\">请在modrinth上找到该模组以获得最佳体验！</a></p><h2>功能</h2><h3><strong>酿造台配方书</strong></h3><p><img src=\"https://github.com/mrshmllow/BetterRecipeBook/assets/40532058/73c81196-9563-4482-8d4e-b0b980ee8f12\" alt=\"one\"></p><h3><strong>锻造台配方书</strong></h3><p><img src=\"https://github.com/mrshmllow/BetterRecipeBook/assets/40532058/30f27b5b-7e4d-4c81-8229-33c0d8391783\" alt=\"two\"></p><h3><strong>固定常用配方</strong></h3><p>使用快捷键将配方固定在顶部</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/mrshmllow/BetterRecipeBook/assets/40532058/aadc51e7-68fa-42a2-9672-6deadd77b91e\" alt=\"three\"></p><h3><strong>即时制作切换</strong></h3><p>启用后只需点击一次即可制作。按住Shift键可制作尽可能多的物品。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/mrshmllow/BetterRecipeBook/assets/40532058/cb8f0305-fea7-4547-8e91-ff0c17e25ada\" alt=\"four\"></p><h3><strong>查看锁定配方</strong></h3><p>可选地查看你尚未解锁的配方。仅客户端！</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/mrshmllow/BetterRecipeBook/assets/40532058/6a4ebc98-a5ee-4271-97d0-b2af6f13a60a\" alt=\"image\"></p><h3><strong>取消配方分组</strong></h3><p>如果你喜欢固定特定配方，这将非常有用！</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/mrshmllow/BetterRecipeBook/assets/40532058/e8abc1f1-6b37-4447-895c-0c86a02d38d8\" alt=\"five_compare\"></p><h3><strong>还有更多...</strong></h3><ul>\n<li>使用鼠标滚轮翻页</li>\n<li>打开配方书时保持制作界面居中</li>\n<li>显示熔炉配方，让你<em>真正</em>看到它们：</li>\n</ul><p><strong>现在</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mrshmllow/BetterRecipeBook/main/.github/images/furnace/now.png\" alt=\"now\"></p><p><strong>之前</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mrshmllow/BetterRecipeBook/main/.github/images/furnace/then.png\" alt=\"then\"></p><ul>\n<li>启用或禁用解锁动画</li>\n</ul><p>哦... 如果你愿意，你也可以完全禁用配方书。</p>",
